From 887ad69ee75d98dea43c5890733f2eda7059b44f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eryk Wieliczko <eryk@wieliczko.ninja>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:17:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 19/27] thermal: apple: add the J713 PMP CPU policy

Bind CPU protection and measured-rail budgeting to owner-managed PMP
telemetry. Separate the explicitly provisional emergency shutdown policy
from Linux cooling controls and document the unqualified firmware limits.
Keep startup, provider lifetime and policy coverage with the implementation.

